  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><strong>靈魂字體</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">描述</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">這款基於人氣《黑暗靈魂》系列、帶有哥特與中世紀風格的字體將進一步提升您的原版遊戲體驗，且易於閱讀。最初為 <a style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a> 整合包設計，現已公開提供！<br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">本字體基於 Manfred Klein 設計的 <a style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffontmeme.com%252ffonts%252foptimus-princeps-font%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Optimus Princeps 字體</a>&nbsp;。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">此字體採用免費字體授權（Free Font License）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/776/210/souls-font-characaters.PNG\" width=\"645\" height=\"734\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><strong>螢幕截圖（來自 DarkRPG）</strong></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/776/209/2023-12-18_00.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"447\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即租用伺服器，與好友同樂！點擊 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a> 或下方橫幅，並輸入優惠碼 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 即可享 25% 折扣！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:symbol;font-size:24px\">黑暗即將降臨...</span></p>",
